<title>CHINA: TABLE-Yiu Wing net returns to profit.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Yiu Wing net returns to profit.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	  0.17 gain   vs 8.90 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)   nil	   vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	 33.24 gain  vs 13.72 loss</p>
<p>    Net			   0.86 profit vs 42.74 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		    1,054.62    vs 653.96</p>
<p>    Company name		Yiu Wing International Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		 September 22-26</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	  N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Construction company Yiu Wing also operates restaurants.</p>
<p>The company proposed a bonus issue of one 1998 warrant for every 10 shares held. The bonus warrants will entitle holders thereof to subscribe for shares of the company at a subscription price of HK$2.80 per share (subject to adjustment) from the date of issue to December 31, 1998.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain of HK$19.20 million on disposal of an investment property, gain of HK$11.57 million on disposal of long term investments and gain of HK$2.47 million on disposal of short term investments.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
